# stray local VM build artifacts (never commit binaries)
/aivm-gov-mcp
# Rooted: `go build ./<vm>/cmd/plugin` from here drops a `plugin` binary in the
# repo root. Unrooted, this pattern also matched every `<vm>/cmd/plugin`
# DIRECTORY, so a new file under one was silently unaddable — `git add` printed
# a hint and staged nothing. mpcvm's and bridgevm's plugin tests were written,
# pass, and are not in the repository.
/plugin
